---
// Metrics3: three bordered cards with a big number, label, explanation and a mini progress bar.
---

<section class="bg-surface py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-4xl">What changes after ninety days</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">Three things teams notice first, measured against the quarter before they switched.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="flex flex-col rounded-card border border-line bg-bg p-8 shadow-sm">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-muted">On-time delivery</p>
        <p class="mt-4 font-display text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">94%</p>
        <p class="mt-4 flex-1 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">Projects land on the date the team first agreed to, because the plan stays honest as the work changes.</p>
        <div class="mt-8">
          <div class="h-2 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-brand-100 dark:bg-brand-950/60" role="img" aria-label="94 percent, up from 71 percent">
            <div class="h-full w-[94%] rounded-full bg-brand-600 dark:bg-brand-500"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-muted">
            <span>Before: 71%</span>
            <span class="font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">+23 points</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col rounded-card border border-line bg-bg p-8 shadow-sm">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-muted">Meeting load</p>
        <p class="mt-4 font-display text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">38%</p>
        <p class="mt-4 flex-1 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">Fewer hours in status meetings each week, replaced by a Monday digest everyone actually reads.</p>
        <div class="mt-8">
          <div class="h-2 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-brand-100 dark:bg-brand-950/60" role="img" aria-label="38 percent reduction in meeting hours">
            <div class="h-full w-[38%] rounded-full bg-brand-600 dark:bg-brand-500"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-muted">
            <span>Before: 6.2h a week</span>
            <span class="font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">Now: 3.8h</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col rounded-card border border-line bg-bg p-8 shadow-sm">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-muted">Weekly active use</p>
        <p class="mt-4 font-display text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">87%</p>
        <p class="mt-4 flex-1 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">Nearly everyone invited is still planning in Halcyon three months later, without a single reminder from their manager.</p>
        <div class="mt-8">
          <div class="h-2 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-brand-100 dark:bg-brand-950/60" role="img" aria-label="87 percent weekly active use">
            <div class="h-full w-[87%] rounded-full bg-brand-600 dark:bg-brand-500"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-muted">
            <span>Industry typical: 45%</span>
            <span class="font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">Nearly 2× higher</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
